    "summary": "Defined six source-closed optimization workload v2 contracts for representative and held-out dense-integral, cubic-factorization, and hyperelliptic-normalization public boundaries. Added strict current-epoch discovery evidence validation with exact alternating 11-pair protocols, complete conversion/crossing/copy/allocation/result/resource accounting, exact semantic and fallback obligations, mature-capability identities, negative alternatives, and deterministic generalized-auditor adjudication. Added a bench-only lawful FLINT block decomposition whose executable GF(257) length-10000 witness proves exact output/derivative equality, 39 calls over 38 characteristic holes, and the untouched singular ZeroDivisionError without modifying production routes.",
